sequenceDiagram
  actor Manager as Manager
  actor Other as Non-Manager user
  participant Portal as Web portal
  participant Authz as Authorization
  participant Consent as Consent authoring service
  participant Store as ConsentDefinition store
  participant Gate as Mandatory-consent gate

  Manager->>Portal: Open consent authoring
  Portal->>Authz: Check role is Manager
  Authz-->>Portal: Authorized
  Portal->>Consent: List consent definitions
  Consent->>Store: Read definitions (Key, Version, Body)
  Store-->>Consent: Definitions and bodies
  Consent-->>Portal: Show current consent texts

  alt In-place correction (same Version)
    Manager->>Portal: Edit Title/Url/Body
    Portal->>Consent: Save in-place correction
    Consent->>Store: Update Body, keep {Key, Version}
    Store-->>Consent: Saved (audit who/when)
    Consent-->>Portal: No re-consent triggered
  else Publish new version
    Manager->>Portal: Provide new Version and Body
    Portal->>Consent: Publish new version
    Consent->>Store: Insert new active definition (new Version)
    Store-->>Consent: Saved, history intact (audit who/when)
    Consent-->>Gate: Latest version per Key changed
    Gate-->>Portal: Users re-prompted (HTTP 451 consent_required)
  end

  Other->>Portal: Attempt consent authoring
  Portal->>Authz: Check role is Manager
  Authz-->>Portal: Not authorized
  Portal-->>Other: HTTP 403 Forbidden (no change persisted)
